# ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

Current names (use these in new prose and new headers):

  SIX     Sensorimotor Integration aXis
  SCX     Systemic Coherence aXis
  ICX     Soul Identity aXis
  SUXS-IFO    fusion operator \mathcal{U}
  Equilibrium Manifold
  Balance State Vector
  APS-OKF
